WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.170
Researcher Murray selected two pairs&nbsp;
of Christmas stockings for testing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.690
all decorated with the face of Santa Claus.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:10.890
The first pair was placed on the setting&nbsp;
"Coarse." The output produced was a pair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:16.110
of off-color red stockings with poorly woven&nbsp;
cotton. The face of Santa was replaced with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:20.550
crude drawing of a stick figure with a&nbsp;
Christmas hat, riding a surfboard. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:25.830
phrase "AuSSIE ChriSTmas Is HeRe." was&nbsp;
woven into the back with black cotton.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.490
The second pair was placed on the&nbsp;
setting "Fine." The result was a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:34.290
cotton vinyl containing the entire music&nbsp;
collection from the band "Bucko &amp; Champs",&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:39.450
with songs containing themes of Christmas&nbsp;
underlined with red lines woven into the fabric.

